{"task_id":"A01","domain":"assembly","title":"支架与底座装配","instruction":"分别准备底座和支架，双单元共同对齐；拧紧两处紧固点，检查后贴完成标签。两处紧固使用同一把扭矩工具。","S0":["base_available","bracket_available","bolts_available","label_available"],"Sg":["bracket_assembly_labeled"],"resources":["base","bracket","torque_tool","label_printer"]},
