{"task_id":"A03","domain":"assembly","title":"密封壳体装配","instruction":"分别清洁下壳和检查上盖；安装密封圈，双单元闭合壳体，依次紧固两个盖位，进行泄漏检查，再双单元转移至完成托盘。","S0":["lower_shell_available","cover_available","gasket_available","tray_ready"],"Sg":["housing_on_finished_tray"],"resources":["lower_shell","cover","gasket","driver","leak_tester","finished_tray"]},
