{"task_id":"P04","domain":"packaging","title":"双容器保温运输箱","instruction":"准备运输外箱、两个保温内衬和两件已密封样品。分别装好内衬及样品，放入吸附垫；双单元先装第一容器再装第二容器，加入记录卡，封箱称重并标识。样品已密封，本任务不处理样品内容。","S0":["shipper_ready","liner_a_available","liner_b_available","sealed_sample_a","sealed_sample_b","pads_available","record_data_ready"],"Sg":["insulated_shipper_ready"],"resources":["shipper","liner_a","liner_b","sample_a","sample_b","pads","printer","scale","sealer"]},
{"task_id":"I01","domain":"inspection","title":"两零件尺寸检测","instruction":"准备两个零件和已校准量具，共用卡尺分别测量并记录尺寸，打印合并检验单，将两件已检零件放入检验完成托盘。","S0":["part_a_available","part_b_available","caliper_calibrated","inspection_tray_ready"],"Sg":["inspection_lot_documented"],"resources":["part_a","part_b","caliper","printer","inspection_tray"]},
{"task_id":"I02","domain":"inspection","title":"电气模块台架检验","instruction":"确认台架就绪，准备模块和测试线；双单元把模块置于台架，接线，执行通断测试和绝缘测试，归档结果后移至合格区。测试仪为容量1共享资源。","S0":["bench_available","module_available","leads_available","test_program_available"],"Sg":["module_in_pass_area"],"resources":["bench","module","leads","tester","record_terminal","pass_tray"]},
