{"task_id":"I04","domain":"inspection","title":"装配件追溯复核","instruction":"核对主体序列号和附属模块号，共用扫码器；分别确认装配紧固记录与电测记录。双单元翻面查看背面标签，合并身份与检验记录，打印放行签并转入完成区。","S0":["assembly_available","submodule_available","torque_record_available","electrical_record_available","release_tray_ready"],"Sg":["assembly_released"],"resources":["assembly","submodule","scanner","review_terminal","printer","release_tray"]},
{"task_id":"W01","domain":"warehouse","title":"两个周转盒合并","instruction":"扫描两个来源周转盒，分别准备目标盒的左右区域；双单元将左盒内容移入目标盒，再将右盒内容移入，最后核对合并数量并标记。","S0":["source_a_ready","source_b_ready","target_tote_empty","manifest_ready"],"Sg":["consolidated_tote_labeled"],"resources":["source_a","source_b","target_tote","scanner","printer"]},
{"task_id":"W02","domain":"warehouse","title":"两货位补货","instruction":"先确认两货位空余，再扫码两批补货箱；把每批箱送到对应货位并核对数量，两个货位的记录都完成后结束工单。共用扫码器和登记终端。","S0":["bin_a_available","bin_b_available","carton_a_available","carton_b_available","replenishment_order_ready"],"Sg":["replenishment_order_closed"],"resources":["bin_a","bin_b","carton_a","carton_b","scanner","terminal"]},
