{"task_id":"W04","domain":"warehouse","title":"三来源订单齐套","instruction":"从三个来源分别取A、B、C组件，共用扫码器核对；准备订单周转盒，按盒内分区装入三组件，检查齐套后双单元转移周转盒并登记完成。","S0":["stock_a_ready","stock_b_ready","stock_c_ready","order_tote_empty","pick_order_ready","dispatch_area_ready"],"Sg":["kit_dispatch_recorded"],"resources":["stock_a","stock_b","stock_c","scanner","order_tote","terminal"]},
{"task_id":"S01","domain":"sorting","title":"三类包裹分拣","instruction":"分别扫描A、B、C包裹并读取目标分类，使用同一扫码器；将它们放入各自目标格，三个分类结果完成后记录批次完成。","S0":["parcel_a_ready","parcel_b_ready","parcel_c_ready","bins_ready","sort_manifest_ready"],"Sg":["sorting_batch_recorded"],"resources":["parcel_a","parcel_b","parcel_c","scanner","bin_a","bin_b","bin_c","terminal"]},
{"task_id":"S02","domain":"sorting","title":"返修件与合格件分流","instruction":"准备两个待判定件及两个分流托盘；在同一检验台依次确认件A为合格、件B为需返修，打印各自标签，分别放入对应托盘，登记两条流转记录。","S0":["item_a_available","item_b_available","pass_tray_ready","rework_tray_ready","inspection_rules_ready"],"Sg":["routing_complete"],"resources":["item_a","item_b","inspection_station","printer","pass_tray","rework_tray","terminal"]},
